  "title": {
   "en": "Mou Furenai Kimi"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "もう触れないキミ"
   },
   {
    "en": "I Won't Touch You Anymore"
   },
   {
    "en": "You Who Can't Touch Me Anymore"
   },
   {
    "vi": "Tớ không thể chạm vào cậu được nữa"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In their high school days Shiraishi would tease her classmate Arashi constantly always touching his shaved head. Now, many years later, Shiraishi finds herself enthralled with a rising celebrity that she sees on TV an in magazines. This celebrity being none other that Arashi, her former classmate, now with long grown out hair. She wanders the streets hoping that by some happenstance she might once again meet him and be able to tell him the things she's kept in her heart for so many years. A tale of lost opportunities and love separated by time...",
   "ja": "いつも隣にいたアイツは、遥か遠くへ――。国民的人気者となり、手の届かないところへ行ってしまった坊主頭だったアイツ。いつも雑誌や画面越しに見ていたけれど、もしかしてアイツもウチのことを覚えてる？かつてはいつも触れられる距離にいたふたりの距離が再び近づいたとき、衝撃の事実が明らかに――。"
  },
